  "definition": "Registered Pharmacy Technician Duties",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-05-26",
  "historyNote": "#10720, eff 11-22-14; ss by #12671, eff 11-17-18; ss by #12951, eff 12-21-19; ss by #13385, eff 5-26-22",
